### Dataset Attribution & License Notice:
SurfaceGuard AI evaluates on the MVTec Anomaly Detection (MVTec AD) dataset.
MVTec AD is created by MVTec Software GmbH and is licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International License (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0).
https://www.mvtec.com/research-teaching/datasets/mvtec-ad

Citation:
Paul Bergmann, Michael Fauser, David Sattlegger, Carsten Steger.
MVTec AD — A Comprehensive Real-World Dataset for Unsupervised Anomaly Detection;
in: IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2019.
